    <bpmn:process id="W_W3356" name="W3356. Congressional &amp; Executive-Agency Engagement (DTI/DOLE/BIR/BSP/NTC etc.)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Advocacy need (W3355); relationship maintenance; consultation
Frequency: Per engagement
Volume: ~hundreds of engagements/year
Owner: Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Govt Affairs Mgr, Leadership, VP Legal &amp; Compliance, affected SMEs, Compliance (links to VS-22)
Source: workflow W3356 — Congressional &amp; Executive-Agency Engagement (DTI/DOLE/BIR/BSP/NTC etc.)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3356_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3356_Lane1" name="Govt Affairs Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3356_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3356_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3356_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3356_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3356_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3356_Start3" name="Advocacy need (W3355); relationship maintenance; consultation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3356_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3356_Task4" name="Govt Affairs Mgr plan the engagement: objective, audience (committee chair…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govt Affairs Mgr plan the engagement: objective, audience (committee chair, agency director), BuildRight spokespeople, briefing materials, and ask; secure executive availability (W3359) and legal review
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per engagement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3356_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3356_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3356_Task5" name="Govt Affairs Mgr/Leadership conduct the engagement (meeting, hearing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govt Affairs Mgr/Leadership conduct the engagement (meeting, hearing, consultation, site visit): present BuildRight&#x27;s position and data, listen, answer questions, and build credibility; coordinate with compliance execution (links to VS-22.2) where relevant
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr / Leadership
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per engagement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3356_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3356_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3356_Task6" name="Govt Affairs Mgr document the engagement, commitments, and follow-ups; execute…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govt Affairs Mgr document the engagement, commitments, and follow-ups; execute follow-up (W3357 submissions, further engagement), update stakeholder map (W3353), and brief leadership
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per engagement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3356_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3356_End7" name="Complete">
