Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per submission</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3357_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3357_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
