        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govt Affairs Mgr build/manage the coalition: align positions, divide advocacy roles, coordinate submissions (W3357) and engagements (W3356), and present a unified industry voice; manage confidentiality and antitrust guardrails (links to VS-86)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per issue</bpmn:documentation>
