Volume: All external-affairs activity
Owner: Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Govt Affairs Mgr, Legal (links to VS-100), Compliance (links to VS-22), Anti-Corruption (links to VS-86.3), Internal Audit (links to VS-21.1)
Source: workflow W3360 — Political-Activity Compliance, Lobbying Disclosure &amp; Ethics</bpmn:documentation>
